        {
          "en": "This game uses the words from the story.",
          "zh": "这个游戏我们这单词从这故事。",
          "startMs": 4800,
          "endMs": 8398
        },
        {
          "en": "• Choose one of the words from the book and make the face.",
          "zh": "• 选择一的这单词从这书和做这脸。",
          "startMs": 8398,
          "endMs": 13614
        },
        {
          "en": "The child has to guess the word.",
          "zh": "这孩子有到猜测这单词。",
          "startMs": 13614,
          "endMs": 16492
        },
        {
          "en": "• Then the child looks in the book and chooses a face to make.",
          "zh": "• 然后这孩子看在……里这书和选择一个脸到做。",
          "startMs": 16492,
          "endMs": 22068
        },
        {
          "en": "You guess the word.",
          "zh": "你猜测这单词。",
          "startMs": 22068,
          "endMs": 23777
        },
        {
          "en": "• Think of other words that describe how people feel and act them out.",
          "zh": "• 想的其他单词那个描述如何人们感觉和行为他们出。",
          "startMs": 23777,
          "endMs": 30073
        },
        {
